OL,3,GNEWSAStory behind the shipwreck
OL,4,Arevealed at low tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the Rosa was built in South
OL,7,FShields in 1915. Originally given the
OL,8,Fpractical name C64, it was used by the
OL,9,FRoyal Navy to carry messages and stores
OL,10,Fbetween warships and the shore.
